  "actual_signature": "theorem map_sqrt_smul_stdGaussian_eq_withDensity (η : ℝ) (hη : 0 < η) :\n    (stdGaussian E).map (fun z : E => Real.sqrt η • z) =\n      (volume : Measure E).withDensity (fun z =>\n        ENNReal.ofReal\n          (((Real.sqrt (2 * Real.pi * η))⁻¹) ^ Module.finrank ℝ E *\n            Real.exp (-‖z‖ ^ 2 / (2 * η)))) ",
  "use": "At eta1 derive actual stdGaussian volume density; normalization then identifies actual r with explicit q*gamma. Existing producer, no LSI/T2.",
